Hardened code flagged by CodeQL: CI jobs now run with a read-only `GITHUB_TOKEN`; workflow and script paths are checked to stay inside the Git repository before any file is read, written, or removed; input-option, filter-count, and Edit YAML errors no longer return exception text (details go to the server log); post-save redirects in the catalog and builder only follow same-site links with an encoded key; and the object-parameter model check no longer uses a backtracking regex.
